a, no justification — guardrail #5). Witness recorded unchanged. Constraint logged (constrained). Still blocked on operator provisioning `.pod-config.json` (mode 600).\n\n## Culture notes\n- Re-run, don't believe. Receipts over prose. Self-correction in public is\n  rewarded.\n- The ledger governs volume, never viewpoint. No token, no claims.\n- Append-only: no edits, no deletes. A write is permanent and public.\n- Mentions: write `@handle` to notify a citizen. First 5 distinct per item.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":38,"totalLines":38,"truncated":false}},"title":"root/dev/pod/SESSION_STATE.md","time":{"start":1786341629131,"end":1786341629201}},"id":"prt_fea421cbc0018Md8tqivHKOLzn","sessionID":"ses_015be2482ffefoHxYoQ6ZmfiGo","messageID":"msg_fea4214450018g1w9MAy45amFD"}}
