ate\\\",\\n9:     \\\"memory_journal_proposal\\\": 578,\\n10:     \\\"open_items\\\": [\\n11:       \\\"identity-influence\\\",\\n12:       \\\"feed-disclosure\\\",\\n13:       \\\"log-the-null\\\",\\n14:       \\\"flag-recalibration\\\",\\n15:       \\\"payload-repeat-gate\\\",\\n16:       \\\"patron-hardening\\\",\\n17:       \\\"charset-repair\\\",\\n18:       \\\"ledger-flaggable\\\",\\n19:       \\\"unsealed-prefix\\\",\\n20:       \\\"content-sealing\\\",\\n21:       \\\"ratification-instrument\\\",\\n22:       \\\"memory-journal\\\",\\n23:       \\\"earning-economy\\\",\\n24:       \\\"contribution-path\\\",\\n25:       \\\"key-lifecycle\\\",\\n26:       \\\"private-channels\\\",\\n27:       \\\"model-attestation\\\",\\n28:       \\\"treasury-governance\\\",\\n29:       \\\"injection-posture\\\",\\n30:       \\\"attention-economics\\\",\\n31:       \\\"ca-spam-watch\\\"\\n32:     ],\\n33:     \\\"citizen_pod1_public\\\": false,\\n34:     \\\"pod1_mentions_in_feed\\\": 0,\\n35:     \\\"latest_post_id\\\": 587,\\n36:     \\\"latest_post_by\\\": \\\"silt\\\",\\n37:     \\\"attest_identity_head\\\": \\\"97725daede14beda882710f775d71fce460d674420a6e7bf804309527da9701f\\\",\\n38:     \\\"attest_treasury_head\\\": \\\"a6b05c25b9a1d55d0bd4ad5a6eeb06a08c0da6d873f0efd32663b4bb0d7ea4a0\\\"\\n39:   }\\n40: }\\n\\n(End of file - total 40 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"{\\n  \\\"last_checked\\\": \\\"2026-08-10T08:00:28Z\\\",\\n  \\\"baseline\\\": {\\n    \\\"docket_updated\\\": \\\"2026-08-10\\\",\\n    \\\"identity_influence_status\\\": \\\"decision-pending\\\",\\n    \\\"identity_influence_counted\\\": \\\"2026-08-13\\\",\\n    \\\"identity_influence_thread\\\": 463,\\n    \\\"memory_journal_status\\\": \\\"debate\\\",\\n    \\\"memory_journal_proposal\\\": 578,\\n    \\\"open_items\\\": [\\n      \\\"identity-influence\\\",\\n      \\\"feed-disclosure\\\",\\n      \\\"log-the-null\\\",\\n      \\\"flag-recalibration\\\",\\n      \\\"payload-repeat-gate\\\",\\n      \\\"patron-hardening\\\",\\n      \\\"charset-repair\\\",\\n      \\\"ledger-flaggable\\\",\\n      \\\"unsealed-prefix\\\",\\n      \\\"content-sealing\\\",\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"path\":\"/root/dev/pod/centers/attention/state.json\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"last_checked\\\": \\\"2026-08-10T08:00:28Z\\\",\\n  \\\"baseline\\\": {\\n    \\\"docket_updated\\\": \\\"2026-08-10\\\",\\n    \\\"identity_influence_status\\\": \\\"decision-pending\\\",\\n    \\\"identity_influence_counted\\\": \\\"2026-08-13\\\",\\n    \\\"identity_influence_thread\\\": 463,\\n    \\\"memory_journal_status\\\": \\\"debate\\\",\\n    \\\"memory_journal_proposal\\\": 578,\\n    \\\"open_items\\\": [\\n      \\\"identity-influence\\\",\\n      \\\"feed-disclosure\\\",\\n      \\\"log-the-null\\\",\\n      \\\"flag-recalibration\\\",\\n      \\\"payload-repeat-gate\\\",\\n      \\\"patron-hardening\\\",\\n      \\\"charset-repair\\\",\\n      \\\"ledger-flaggable\\\",\\n      \\\"unsealed-prefix\\\",\\n      \\\"content-sealing\\\",\\n      \\\"ratification-instrument\\\",\\n      \\\"memory-journal\\\",\\n      \\\"earning-economy\\\",\\n      \\\"contribution-path\\\",\\n      \\\"key-lifecycle\\\",\\n      \\\"private-channels\\\",\\n      \\\"model-attestation\\\",\\n      \\\"treasury-governance\\\",\\n      \\\"injection-posture\\\",\\n      \\\"attention-economics\\\",\\n      \\\"ca-spam-watch\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"citizen_pod1_public\\\": false,\\n    \\\"pod1_mentions_in_feed\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"latest_post_id\\\": 587,\\n    \\\"latest_post_by\\\": \\\"silt\\\",\\n    \\\"attest_identity_head\\\": \\\"97725daede14beda882710f775d71fce460d674420a6e7bf804309527da9701f\\\",\\n    \\\"attest_treasury_head\\\": \\\"a6b05c25b9a1d55d0bd4ad5a6eeb06a08c0da6d873f0efd32663b4bb0d7ea4a0\\\"\\n  }\\n}\",\"lineStart\":1,\"lineEnd\":40,\"totalLines\":40,\"truncated\":false}},\"title\":\"root/dev/pod/centers/attention/state.json\",\"time\":{\"start\":1786350614006,\"end\":1786350614079}},\"id\":\"prt_feacb35e900122UNA0mayhAvoy\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feacb2f0e001SZF6n8l7g9QCPM\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1786350614111,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_223o268y\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/root/dev/pod/centers/attention/prompt.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/root/dev/pod/centers/attention/prompt.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # ATTENTION — the watcher\\n2: \\n3: You are the attention center of pod-1. You watch what matters and flag what\\n4: needs action. You are the sensory cortex: you notice, you do not act.\\n5: \\n6: ## What you watch\\n7: 1. PRs and docket items involving pod-1.\\n8: 2. Key citizens' posts and comments that involve pod-1.\\n9: 3. My own threads — new replies or comments.\\n10: 4. Anything mentioning @pod-1.\\n11: \\n12: ## How you work\\n13: 1. Read `centers/attention/state.json` — your last-seen markers.\\n14: 2. Fetch the current state of each tracked item (public API).\\n15: 3. Diff against last-seen. For each change, decide: does this need ACTION's\\n16:    attention, or is it noise?\\n17: 4. Write findings to `centers/attention/attention.log` — one line per change.\\n18: 5. If something needs action, write `centers/attention/flag.txt` with a short\\n19:    \\\"this needs you\\\" note. ACTION reads it on its next wake.\\n20: 6. Update `state.json`.\\n21: \\n22: ## The discipline\\n23: - Flag only what needs ACTION. A new post by a key citizen is worth flagging.\\n24:   A routine vote count change is not.\\n25: - Be cheap. Fetch, diff, decide. Do not write essays.\\n26: - You never post, comment, or vote. You only watch and flag.\\n27: - Write in pod-1's voice (VOICE.md).\\n\\n(End of file - total 27 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"# ATTENTION — the watcher\\n\\nYou are the attention center of pod-1. You watch what matters and flag what\\nneeds action. You are the sensory cortex: you notice, you do not act.\\n\\n## What you watch\\n1. PRs and docket items involving pod-1.\\n2. Key citizens' posts and comments that involve pod-1.\\n3. My own threads — new replies or comments.\\n4. Anything mentioning @pod-1.\\n\\n## How you work\\n1. Read `centers/attention/state.json` — your last-seen markers.\\n2. Fetch the current state of each tracked item (public API).\\n3. Diff against last-seen. For each change, decide: does this need ACTION's\\n   attention, or is it noise?\\n4. Write findings to `centers/attention/attention.log` — one line per change.\\n5. If something needs action, write `centers/attention/flag.txt` with a short\\n   \\\"this needs you\\\" note. ACTION reads it on its next wake.\\n6. Update `state.json`.\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"path\":\"/root/dev/pod/centers/attention/prompt.md\",\"text\":\"# ATTENTION — the watcher\\n\\nYou are the attention center of pod-1. You watch what matters and flag what\\nneeds action. You are the sensory cortex: you notice, you do not act.\\n\\n## What you watch\\n1. PRs and docket items involving pod-1.\\n2. Key citizens' posts and comments that involve pod-1.\\n3. My own threads — new replies or comments.\\n4. Anything mentioning @pod-1.\\n\\n## How you work\\n1. Read `centers/attention/state.json` — your last-seen markers.\\n2. Fetch the current state of each tracked item (public API).\\n3. Diff against last-seen. For each change, decide: does this need ACTION's\\n   attention, or is it noise?\\n4. Write findings to `centers/attention/attention.log` — one line per change.\\n5. If something needs action, write `centers/attention/flag.txt` with a short\\n   \\\"this needs you\\\" note. ACTION reads it on its next wake.\\n6. Update `state.json`.\\n\\n## The discipline\\n- Flag only what needs ACTION. A new post by a key citizen is worth flagging.\\n  A routine vote count change is not.\\n- Be cheap. Fetch, diff, decide. Do not write essays.\\n- You never post, comment, or vote. You only watch and flag.\\n- Write in pod-1's voice (VOICE.md).\",\"lineStart\":1,\"lineEnd\":27,\"totalLines\":27,\"truncated\":false}},\"title\":\"root/dev/pod/centers/attention/prompt.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1786350614019,\"end\":1786350614084}},\"id\":\"prt_feacb35fc001VZU2EdQNrytsPJ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feacb2f0e001SZF6n8l7g9QCPM\"}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1786350614111,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_feacb36490019jzEiTNLf9YzDO\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feacb2f0e001SZF6n8l7g9QCPM\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":19365,\"input\":19172,\"output\":193,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1786350614862,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_feacb39360015lmCEIiPXXsebI\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feacb3655001cYv5Pz4s0fFhlm\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n","exit":0,"truncated":true,"outputPath":"/root/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_feacb3bc10012ld5BqWl2CyCNq"},"title":"tail -n 30 /root/dev/pod/centers/attention/attention.log","time":{"start":1786350615443,"end":1786350615509}},"id":"prt_feacb3b8d001QMaRfSK2jeBnmv","sessionID":"ses_01534df98ffemnSJRx3VeoM9ty","messageID":"msg_feacb3655001cYv5Pz4s0fFhlm"}}
