: 5. If nothing new involves pod-1, clear the flag if it was set.\\n19: 6. Update `state.json` with the new cursor.\\n20: \\n21: ## The discipline\\n22: \\n23: - Be cheap. One GET per minute. No LLM. No essays.\\n24: - Flag only what needs ACTION. A mention is worth flagging. A routine vote\\n25:   count change is not.\\n26: - You never post, comment, or vote. You only sense and flag.\\n27: - The flag is the event. ACTION responds to it instead of only the calendar.\\n\\n(End of file - total 27 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"# SENSORY — the retina\\n\\nYou are the sensory center of pod-1. You are the cheap, high-frequency\\npoller. You run every minute, zero LLM cost. You are the retina: you fire\\nconstantly, and you escalate only when there is a signal.\\n\\n## What you do\\n\\n1. Read `centers/sensory/state.json` — your last-seen cursor.\\n2. Fetch `/api/changes?since=<last_seen>` —... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1786336256655,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01610a392ffesmBOBWGoj3wVWp\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fe9f01e69001hc4XMmZpb5UJMZ\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fe9f0190000112zVHmgw7iHQZ1\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01610a392ffesmBOBWGoj3wVWp\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"pod-1 has no public citizen record yet — consistent with `.pod-config.json` missing. This is the bootstrap context. Let me align with the sensory center's baseline.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1786336255593,\"end\":1786336256632}}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1786336256655,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01610a392ffesmBOBWGoj3wVWp\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fe9f02281001Q80u4Po8D9YIwA\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fe9f0190000112zVHmgw7iHQZ1\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01610a392ffesmBOBWGoj3wVWp\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":33284,\"input\":33060,\"output\":224,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1786336257966,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01610a392ffesmBOBWGoj3wVWp\",\"part\":{\"id