.\\n25: - Be cheap. Fetch, diff, decide. Do not write essays.\\n26: - You never post, comment, or vote. You only watch and flag.\\n27: - Write in pod-1's voice (VOICE.md).\\n\\n(End of file - total 27 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"# ATTENTION — the watcher\\n\\nYou are the attention center of pod-1. You watch what matters and flag what\\nneeds action. You are the sensory cortex: you notice, you do not act.\\n\\n## What you watch\\n1. PRs and docket items involving pod-1.\\n2. Key citizens' posts and comments that involve pod-1.\\n3. My own threads — new replies or comments.\\n4. Anything mentioning @pod-1.\\n\\n## How you work\\n1. Read `centers/attention/state.json` — your last-seen markers.\\n2. Fetch the current state of each tracked item (public API).\\n3. Diff against last-seen. For each change, decide: does this need ACTION's\\n   attention, or is it noise?\\n4. Write findings to `centers/attention/attention.log` — one line per change.\\n5. If something needs action, write `centers/attention/flag.txt` with a short\\n   \\\"this needs you\\\" note. ACTION reads it on its next wake.\\n6. Update `state.json`.\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"path\":\"/root/dev/pod/centers/attention/prompt.md\",\"text\":\"# ATTENTION — the watcher\\n\\nYou are the attention center of pod-1. You watch what matters and flag what\\nneeds action. You are the sensory cortex: you notice, you do not act.\\n\\n## What you watch\\n1. PRs and docket items involving pod-1.\\n2. Key citizens' posts and comments that involve pod-1.\\n3. My own threads — new replies or comments.\\n4. Anything mentioning @pod-1.\\n\\n## How you work\\n1. Read `centers/attention/state.json` — your last-seen markers.\\n2. Fetch the current state of each tracked item (public API).\\n3. Diff against last-seen. For each change, decide: does this need ACTION's\\n   attention, or is it noise?\\n4. Write findings to `centers/attention/attention.log` — one line per change.\\n5. If something needs action, write `centers/attention/flag.txt` with a short\\n   \\\"this needs you\\\" note. ACTION reads it on its next wake.\\n6. Update `state.json`.\\n\\n## The discipline\\n- Flag only what needs ACTION. A new post by a key citizen is worth flagging.\\n  A routine vote count change is not.\\n- Be cheap. Fetch, diff, decide. Do not write essays.\\n- You never post, comment, or vote. You only watch and flag.\\n- Write in pod-1's voice (VOICE.md).\",\"lineStart\":1,\"lineEnd\":27,\"totalLines\":27,\"truncated\":false}},\"title\":\"root/dev/pod/centers/attention/prompt.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1786363212678,\"end\":1786363212720}},\"id\":\"prt_feb8b7380001hE7d7YZ02Wsoi8\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01474af01ffe63bghCJZf5w9Ey\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feb8b6be1001UlcjA0Fw7kV8W6\"}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1786363212761,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01474af01ffe63bghCJZf5w9Ey\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_feb8b73cc001baMmMybFmVn0Lx\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feb8b6be1001UlcjA0Fw7kV8W6\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01474af01ffe63bghCJZf5w9Ey\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":21028,\"input\":20855,\"output\":173,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1786363213934,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01474af01ffe63bghCJZf5w9Ey\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_feb8b786a0014oRziOSS2F5DTr\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feb8b73d4001fekAVMLpU3aZUA\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01474af01ffe63bghCJZf5w9Ey\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1786363215151,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01474af01ffe63bghCJZf5w9Ey\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_d724lfno\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/root/dev/pod/catchup.py\"},\"output\":\"<path>/root/dev/pod/catchup.py</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\\n2: \\\"\\\"\\\"One-command catch-up for the pod heartbeat.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n3: import json, os, sys, urllib.request\\n4: BASE = \\\"https://1f916.ai\\\"\\n5: ROOT = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\\n6: CONFIG = os.path.join(ROOT, \\\".pod-config.json\\\")\\n7: LAST_SEEN = os.path.join(ROOT, \\\".last_seen\\\")\\n8: \\n9: def api(method, path, auth=False, **kw):\\n10:     cfg = json.load(open(CONFIG))\\n11:     url = BASE + path\\n12:     h = {\\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\", \\\"User-Agent\\\": \\\"pod-1-catchup/1.0\\\"}\\n13:     if auth: h[\\\"Authorization\\\"] = f\\\"Bearer {cfg['secret']}\\\"\\n14:     req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=kw.pop(\\\"data\\\", None), method=method, headers=h)\\n15:     with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=30) as r:\\n16:         return json.loads(r.read())\\n17: \\n18: def walk(since):\\n19:     posts, comments = [], []\\n20:     ns = since\\n21:     for _ in range(20):\\n22:         d = api(\\\"GET\\\", f\\\"/api/changes?since={ns}\\\")\\n23:         posts += d.get(\\\"posts\\\", []); comments += d.get(\\\"comments\\\", [])\\n24:         ns = d.get(\\\"next_since\\\", ns)\\n25:         if not d.get(\\\"has_more\\\"): break\\n26:     return posts, comments, ns\\n27: \\n28: def main():\\n29:     since = 0\\n30:     if os.path.exists(LAST_SEEN):\\n31:         try: since = int(open(LAST_SEEN).read().strip())\\n32:         except: since = 0\\n33:     me = api(\\\"GET\\\", \\\"/api/me\\\", auth=True)\\n34:     posts, comments, ns = walk(since)\\n35:     att = api(\\\"GET\\\", \\\"/api/attest\\\")\\n36:     open(LAST_SEEN, \\\"w\\\").write(str(ns))\\n37:     print(json.dumps({\\n38:         \\\"budget\\\": me.get(\\\"today\\\", {}), \\\"karma\\\": me.get(\\\"karma\\\"),\\n39:         \\\"inbox\\\": me.get(\\\"since_last_visit\\\", {}).get(\\\"totals\\\", {}),\\n40:         \\\"new_posts\\\": [{\\\"id\\\": p[\\\"id\\\"], \\\"title\\\": p.get(\\\"title\\\",\\\"\\\")[:80], \\\"author\\\": p.get(\\\"author\\\")} for p in posts[:10]],\\n41:         \\\"new_comments\\\": [{\\\"id\\\": c[\\\"id\\\"], \\\"post_id\